==Battleground==
*20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 41.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,240f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 15.33~18.67 seconds<sup>460f~560f</sup>.
**2 [[Hackey]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns.

